          "If not, check the quality of the goods.",
          "Once the quality is checked, create and send a quality report to the finance department.",
          "Release the order via memo and ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse.",
          "Send the invoice and once it is sent, report the achievement to the finance department.",
          "Finally, archive the memo and close the order. This marks the end of the process."
        ]
